      "en": "I am very angry with the nations that are at ease; for I was but a little displeased, but they added to the calamity.”",
      "ko": "안일한 열국을 심히 진노하나니 나는 조금만 노하였거늘 그들은 힘을 내어 고난을 더하였음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "70d1dafe12a5ce243a25ba0cb45fb2c4e9c2f3397a4a8e26c924c64b8cbf3dcc",
      "translation_text_hash": "b9a4d277a7b810e6128171681d097c9fbdab266547e283a03f6d2e3157a3cdcf",
